#   local 10: the rule is for zone lab, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   local 11: source user match staff@corp.example is not converted
#   local 13: host name object updates.example.com: a security rule names addresses
#   local 15: host name object www.example.org: a security rule names addresses
